      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 3.37,
          "en": "Now, the Vue CLI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.37,
          "end": 5.14,
          "en": "is not a mandatory tool.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.14,
          "end": 6.55,
          "en": "Let me really make that clear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.55,
          "end": 9.55,
          "en": "It's not the same as the Vue framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.55,
          "end": 11.6,
          "en": "which we've been using thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.6,
          "end": 13.93,
          "en": "It's just an additional tool,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.93,
          "end": 16.91,
          "en": "also managed by the team behind Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.91,
          "end": 19.31,
          "en": "It simply helps us create projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.31,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "with a certain configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 23.17,
          "en": "and with certain built-in tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.17,
          "end": 27.49,
          "en": "that give us all those nice features I was talking about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.49,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "in the last lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.21,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "So it helps us create projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 34.36,
          "en": "and manage projects that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.36,
          "end": 38.64,
          "en": "to build more realistic, bigger applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.64,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "So how do we use the Vue CLI?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.91,
          "en": "Well, the Vue CLI under the hood uses certain tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.91,
          "end": 45.206,
          "en": "which you will need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.206,
          "end": 50.206,
          "en": "The most important tool, which you will need is Node.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.23,
          "end": 53.37,
          "en": "Node.js is a JavaScript runtime,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.37,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "which in the end allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 58.22,
          "en": "to run JavaScript code outside of the browser as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.22,
          "end": 61.24,
          "en": "You could use Node.js to write server-side code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.24,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "with JavaScript but that's not what we're going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.96,
          "end": 65.06,
          "en": "to do in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.06,
          "end": 67.51,
          "en": "This is not a Node.js course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.51,
          "end": 69.77,
          "en": "So you will not learn Node.js here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.77,
          "end": 73.05,
          "en": "and you will also not need to write any Node.js code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73.05,
          "end": 74.59,
          "en": "No worries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.59,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "But we need Node.js installed on our machine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 81.61,
          "en": "because the Vue CLI uses it under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.61,
          "end": 84.71000000000001,
          "en": "So make sure you visit nodejs.org",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.71000000000001,
          "end": 88.03999999999999,
          "en": "and simply download the latest version there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.03999999999999,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "This gives you an installer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 90.83,
          "en": "which you can download",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 90.83,
          "end": 93.1,
          "en": "and you can simply walk through that installer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.1,
          "end": 95.18,
          "en": "and confirm all the defaults.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 95.18,
          "end": 97.69,
          "en": "It's available for all operating systems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 97.69,
          "end": 100.9,
          "en": "and it's a really straightforward installation process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 100.9,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "You don't need any special settings or setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 104.52000000000001,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.52000000000001,
          "end": 106.67,
          "en": "Simply walk through that installer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 106.67,
          "end": 109.25999999999999,
          "en": "and install Node.js on your system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 109.25999999999999,
          "end": 113.003,
          "en": "no matter if you're using Windows or macOS or Linux.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 114.94,
          "en": "Now, once this finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.94,
          "end": 116.8,
          "en": "you've got Node.js installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 116.8,
          "end": 118.49000000000001,
          "en": "which the Vue CLI needs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 118.49000000000001,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "but you've also got this npm tool installed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "That's another tool that comes together with Node.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 128.3,
          "en": "Npm stands for Node Package Manager",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 128.3,
          "end": 131.17,
          "en": "and that's a tool which we're also going to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 131.17,
          "end": 134.92,
          "en": "for example, to install the Vue CLI on our system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134.92,
          "end": 138.71,
          "en": "but also later to install extra packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 138.71,
          "end": 140.6,
          "en": "into our project which we might need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.6,
          "end": 143.34,
          "en": "I'll come back to that when we need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "So let's finish that installation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 149.34,
          "en": "and let's now see how we install the Vue CLI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 149.34,
          "end": 152.14,
          "en": "For that, we can to installation, the official docs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 152.14,
          "end": 153.82,
          "en": "but it's really straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 153.82,
          "end": 156.1,
          "en": "You need Node installed, as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 156.1,
          "end": 158.04,
          "en": "and then once you did install Node,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 158.04,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "you can run this command here",
